 he Jim Henson Company' lies a story. How did these treasured objects come 
 to be\, and what does it take to bring them all the way to Brisbane for th
 is exclusive exhibition? Join Karen Falk (Archives Director and historian\
 , The Jim Henson Company) in conversation with Amanda Slack-Smith (Curator
 ial Manager\, Australian Cinémathèque and curator ‘Make\, Believe\, Ma
 gic’) as they reveal the fascinating stories behind many of the characte
 rs featured in the exhibition.
LOCATION:GOMA\, Stanley Place\, South Bank
URL:https://www.qagoma.qld.gov.au/event/hensonarchive-2026-09-13
