DESCRIPTION:Brisbane's best improv comedy! Queer Show headlines this bangin
 g show. One of our most popular shows\, featuring the best LGBTQIA+ comedi
 ans. They absolutely tear the stage apart every time they perform\, leavin
 g the audience crying with laughter. Opening the show is Crowd Sourced. We
  take all our audience suggestions and write them on a whiteboard. Then a 
 cast of Brisbane's best improvisers turn all these suggestions into hilari
 ous scenes. It's fast-paced and so much fun! Featuring Brisbane's best imp
 rov comedians. TICKETS ARE ONLY $20 ONLINE | $25 ON THE DOOR
LOCATION:Big Fork Theatre\, 252 Saint Pauls Terrace
