SUMMARY:Photo Conservation Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a morning of learning and sharing stories from phot
 ographs. This is a free workshop for Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islan
 der people.We invite you to join us for a free and informative morning foc
 used on the care and preservation of photographs.This session will provide
  valuable insights into the best practices for their protection and longev
 ity.This talk will be presented by State Library’s preservation team who
  will share expert tips on how to properly store and care for photographs\
 , helping you appreciate them while ensuring they remain in good condition
  for years to come. This is an excellent opportunity to learn practical te
 chniques for preserving your photos and to connect with others.Tea and cof
 fee will be provided.
