 s scenes all created on the spot before your beautiful eyes. Gosh\, did we
  mention how beautiful your eyes are? Each performance is like your favour
 ite sketch show\, except there is no script to fall back on. Think of show
 s like Portlandia - but done completely on the fly! This 6 times cage matc
 h winning ensemble and 2025 Big Fork Comedy Festival performers focus on f
 inding organic games in their scenes\, John Comedy weaves together hilario
 us scenes as they explore\, and often ruin\, their character's worlds. Joh
 n Comedy\, Game on! (*excluding Rove McManus) TICKETS $15 ONLINE | $20 ON 
