 me to officially launch it in Brisbane! 🔥 On Friday\, September 18\, Le
 cia will be bringing the Strike to Ignite album launch to The Cave Inn for
  a very special night with my Brisbane friends\, fans and family and her a
 mazing band. ❤️ This is the official Brisbane launch — a night to ce
 lebrate the album\, play some blues\, rock\, improv and everything in betw
 een and hopefully have a whole lot of fun along the way! 🎶 Support act:
  To be announced soon 🍕 Venue opens: 4pm for pizza & load-in 🚪 Doors
 : 6pm 🔞 18+ venue — minors welcome with a parent. Please make sure th
 is is clearly noted on your ticket booking. The venue is fully accessible\
 , with accessible-friendly bathrooms and no stairs required to enter or wa
 tch the music. There are also gluten-free\, vegan and vegetarian food opti
 ons\, plus low and no-alcohol drinks available. I’ve been waiting a long
  time to bring this album home to Brisbane\, so come celebrate with me! 
 🖤🎸🔥 Friday\, September 18 — The Cave Inn\, Brisbane. Tickets ar
 e coming — grab yours and come help me Strike to Ignite! www.lecialouise
 .com [button link="https://events.humanitix.com/strike-to-ignite-album-lau
 nchstriketoignite"]Tickets[/button]
LOCATION:The Cave Inn\, 47 Balaclava St.\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, 4102
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/strike-to-ignite-album-launch/
