BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-1xhry0d@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T040000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T080000
SUMMARY:DEAD HEAD REDEMPTION – Album Launch
DESCRIPTION:It's been a hard road but this wagon train has finally pulled u
 p! DEAD HEAD REDEMPTION are proud to launch their debut album THE WENDIGO 
 HUNTERS here at THE CAVE INN on Saturday September 19th 2026. With support
  from fellow 4017-ers IRESON ROAD and THE COASTAL COWGIRLS\, this will be 
 a night of Hickory-smoked entertainment that's sure to tickle the nostalgi
 a buds. NZ brother and tireless publican Adam Christy\, of Cardigan Bar an
 d State of Appalachia fame\, brings his new project IRESON ROAD to their d
 ebut at the Cave. From gritty blues to powerful dark country ballads\, we 
 are set for an emotional ride into the sunset\, accompanied by wailing gui
 tar and heartbreaking vocals. Playful\, talented\, and gosh-darn rootin'-t
 ootin'\, Sandgate's THE COASTAL COWGIRLS are a female-led bayside band tha
 t blend the dusty trails of country & Americana with the refreshing breeze
  of the coast. Delightful originals\, river-washed classics\, and yee-haw 
 surprises are these boot-stomping blonde's buttercake. Closing the evening
 \, DEAD HEAD REDEMPTION perform their brand-new album The Wendigo Hunters 
 in full from start to finish. Evolved over the past three years\, the song
 s evoke the atmosphere of the mangroves\, the dankness of the swamp\, and 
 the harshness of the open land. Weaving tales of folklore\, injustice\, an
 d murder\, the songs tramp the trail between blues\, outlaw\, and pure roc
 k n' roll. Following the closing track\, they'll bring the night to a head
  with more originals\, and a few rusty rail reworks for good measure! [but
 ton link="https://events.humanitix.com/dead-head-redemption-album-launch"]
  Tickets[/button]
LOCATION:47 Balaclava St\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, Australia\, Queensland
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/dead-head-redemption-album-launch/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-12uzy7w@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T064500
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T084500
SUMMARY:Stradbroke Island Day Trip from Brisbane
DESCRIPTION:Tickets for Stradbroke Island Day Trip from Brisbane 🎫 Ticke
 t for 1 Adult (13+) including: Comfortable ferry ride across Moreton Bay S
 tops at Amity Point\, Point Lookout\, Cylinder Beach\, North Gorge\, and M
 yora Springs Lunch with fantastic views of the Pacific Ocean Opportunity t
 o view koalas\, kangaroos\, dolphins\, turtles and a variety of bird life 
 Free time at Cylinder Beach with the chance to swim Highlights 🏝️ Exp
 lore beaches and wildlife with a guided visit of Stradbroke Island 🐬 Lo
 ok for dolphins\, turtles\, manta rays\, and whales in the waters of Moret
 on Bay 🚶 Take a guided hike along the scenic headlands of North Gorge W
 alk to Point Lookout 🐨 See koalas and kangaroos lounging in their nativ
 e habitat 👪 Small-group tour limited to 21 people ensures a personalise
 d experience with your guide General Info 📅 Date: various dates (select
  during purchase) 🕒 Time: 7:45 a.m. ⏳ Duration: 9 hours 45 minutes 
 📍 Departure point: 222 Margaret St\, Brisbane 👤 Age requirement: 13+
  ♿ Accessibility: this experience is not wheelchair accessible 🍽️ M
 enu options: vegetarian\, halal\, vegan and gluten free meal options may b
 e available but will be limited ❓ For this event\, all sales are final a
 nd tickets can’t be refunded\, changed or modified. For more information
 \, please refer to our T&Cs Description Discover the beaches and wildlife 
 of Queensland on a guided day trip to North Stradbroke Island. Relax on a 
 luxury catamaran cruise across Moreton Bay through the Islands with a chan
 ce to spot dolphins from the viewing deck. Famous for its natural attracti
 ons\, including a resident population of kangaroos and koalas\, the Island
  also offers walking tracks\, marine wildlife viewing\, and a relaxed atmo
 sphere. Swim in the Pacific Ocean\, take a short guided hike\, and have fr
 ee time to explore. Enjoy your guided visit on this Stradbroke Island Day 
 Trip from Brisbane!
LOCATION:Brisbane Skytower by CLLIX
URL:https://feverup.com/m/116429
END:VEVENT
