SUMMARY:Virtual Room Brisbane: An Immersive 3D Team Experience
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Step beyond reality and into another dimension with Brisban
 e's award-winning Immersive 3D collaborative experience —a mind-blowing 
 adventure that fuses teamwork\, technology\, and total immersion. Get read
 y to live the impossible! Highlights 🚀 Dive into the world’s most adv
 anced team-based virtual adventure and experience a total reality transfor
 mation 💥 Move freely through your own dedicated space—walk\, grab\, t
 hrow\, and high-five your teammates in full 3D immersion 🎮 No motion si
 ckness\, no limits—just pure adrenaline and cutting-edge comfort 🌌 Te
 am up to solve epic puzzles\, overcome challenges\, and celebrate your vic
 tories together in real time 🎬 Feel the rush of cinematic-quality visua
 ls and heart-pounding sound that blur the line between the game and realit
 y 👥 Perfect for team building \, adult birthdays \, kids’ birthdays &
  hen’s parties . General Info 📅 Date: Select your date directly in th
 e ticket selector 🕒 Time: hourly from 10 a.m. – 10 p.m. ⏳ Duration:
  40-50 minutes 📍 Location: Virtual Room Brisbane (Edward St\, CBD) 👤
  Age requirement: - Time Travel Chapter 1: 8+ (When played with an adult) 
 - Time Travel Chapter 2: 10+ - Press Start: 12+ - Are We Dead?: 14+ - Aste
 rix: Mission Potions!: 8+ (When played with an adult) 📱 For last-minute
  bookings (within 2 hours of your visit)\, please call +61 4 2250 0206 �
 � Please note: 2-4 players required per game. If you book for more than 
 4 people\, your group will be split into multiple teams playing simultaneo
 usly. 📎 You can check the terms and conditions for this event here ❓ 
