 As the last surviving Zombies\, it’s up to you to stop the scientists fr
 om wiping out your kind. Form your undead team and fight for Zombie surviv
 al in this epic twist of fate! ✨ Asterix: Mission Potions! The village i
 s in danger! Join Asterix and Obelix on a quest to find the missing ingred
 ient for the legendary potion. Solve puzzles\, overcome obstacles\, and sa
 ve the day in true Gaulish style!
LOCATION:Virtual Room Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/471161
